  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html",
  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 711.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 711.01 Applicability.\n\n(a) The O/O of a community water system (CWS) or non-transient, non-community water system (NTNC) shall conduct monitoring to determine compliance with the MCLs for inorganics specified in Env-Dw 704.02.\n\n(b) The O/O of a transient, non-community water system shall conduct monitoring to determine compliance with the nitrate and nitrite MCLs specified in Env-Dw 704.02, in accordance with Env-Dw 711.18 through Env-Dw 711.28.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
}
